### Production readiness
This is **QuickForm** — no additional build steps needed. When you're ready to go live:
1. `uip solution pack . ./out` (from inside `POReviewSolution/`)
2. `uip solution publish ./out/<package>.zip`
3. Wire up your real ERP/fetch logic in the `fetchPOData1` script node

The `processDecision1` script already has `TODO` markers showing exactly where to plug in your ERP approval/rejection calls.

